WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Saved URLs with the same hostname are grouped into one Domain

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Three fictional domains, with two URLs each. Different hostnames form separate groups

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Domain mode groups by site. Parent and child categories add more organization
